   ```bash
   curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/search \
   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
   -d '{"search_content": "Hello World", "search_filename": "file.txt", "search_dir": "/songs"}'
   ```

3. Expected Response:
   - If matching files are found:
     ```json
     {
       "files": ["/data/songs/file1.txt", "/data/songs/file2.txt"]
     }
